## 9. Push (FCM)

**Файлы:** `push_notifications_service.dart`, `push_ios_diagnostics.dart`, `main.dart`, `auth_service.dart`

На **iOS** в профиле — блок «Диагностика push» (`PushIosDiagnostics`). Тест с VPS: `node scripts/send-test-push.js <login-email>`.

```text
AndroidManifest: firebase_messaging_auto_init_enabled=false
bootstrap → setAutoInitEnabled(false)
postFrame initialize → permission, listeners
iOS: wait getAPNSToken → ensureFcmToken; foreground presentation options
ensureFcmToken → ждать GMS (Android) → setAutoInitEnabled(true) → getToken с retry
onTokenRefresh → register on server
MyApp слушает requestOpenStream / requestUpdateStream
  request_files_update → refresh detail + RequestAttentionCubit.markFileHighlights
```

**Не переносить** `getToken` в `main()` до `runApp`.

